**Description**

When remote logging is enable, logs are sent to S3/Google Cloud Storage/etc but never deleted from the local disk. This can be an issue when the disk space in the workers is limited.

**Use case / motivation**

Local logs should be deleted when upload to the remote services is successful. 

**Are you willing to submit a PR?**

Yes.

**Related Issues**

Not that I'm aware of.
  </issue>
  
